            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">This unit&apos;s **Gryph-crow** is a token. Subtract 1 from casting rolls and chanting rolls for enemy units within 12&quot; of this unit while its **Gryph-crow** is on the battlefield.
If you make an unmodified save roll of 1 for this unit, remove its **Gryph-crow** from the battlefield after the **^^Attack^^** ability has been resolved (the damage point is still inflicted).</characteristic>
