            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">You can pick a friendly **Knight-Questor** within this unit&apos;s combat range to be the target.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Remove this unit from the battlefield and set it up again on the battlefield more than 9&quot; from all enemy units. Then, if you picked a target, remove it from the battlefield and set it up again within this unit&apos;s combat range and more than 9&quot; from all enemy units.</characteristic>
