            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Charge Phase</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick this unit and another visible friendly **^^Warrior Chamber^^** unit within 3&quot; of it to be the targets.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For the rest of the phase, when making charge rolls for the targets, add 1 to the number of dice rolled, then remove 1 dice of your choice and use the remaining dice as the charge roll.</characteristic>
