            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For the rest of the turn, this unit has **^^Ward (4+)^^**. Remove this unit&apos;s **Gryph-hound** from the battlefield at the end of the turn.</characteristic>
