            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">This unit&apos;s **Gryph-hound** is a token. If this unit&apos;s **Gryph-hound** has been removed, it can no longer attack with its **Gryph-hound&apos;s Beak** and it cannot use the &apos;Loyal Companion&apos; ability</characteristic>
