            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If this unit has not used a **^^Move^^** ability this turn and was not set up this turn, this unit&apos;s shooting attacks score critical hits on unmodified hit rolls of 5+ for the rest of the turn.</characteristic>
