            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 3+, pick 1 of the following effects:
• For the rest of the turn, subtract 1 from hit rolls for attacks made by enemy units while they are in combat with this unit.
• Heal (D3) each friendly **^^Stormcast Eternals^^** unit within this unit&apos;s combat range.</characteristic>
